==German==

===Etymology===
Literally "clearing up".

===Noun===
{{de-noun-f|plural=Aufklärungen}}

# the act of [[enlighten]]ing; an instance of [[enlighten]]ing
# the [[Age of Enlightenment]]
#:'''''Aufklärung''' ist der Ausgang des Menschen aus seiner selbstverschuldeten Unmündigkeit.''
#:"Enlightenment is man's leaving his self-caused immaturity." - [[Wikipedia:Immanuel Kant|Immanuel Kant]] 1783
# [[sex education]]
# [[clarification]], as of a criminal case, mystery, etc.
# (''secret services'') [[intelligence]]

